    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/extras/47c64cd584da225bf1f518b8bb8c4c3c.avif?t=1749920721\" width=567 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CIVITA is a First-Person Shooter game that offers  multiplayer PVP action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use a variety of weapons and equipment to cooperate with their teammates or face off against enemies alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the standout features of this game is the rope action, which allows players to move quickly between buildings or strategically ambush enemies from high vantage points, providing a unique combat experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, with its long TTK, each battle is prolonged and more strategic, giving players more opportunities to turn the tide of combat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772550/extras/47c64cd584da225bf1f518b8bb8c4c3c.avif?t=1749920721\" width=567 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CIVITA is a First-Person Shooter game that offers  multiplayer PVP action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use a variety of weapons and equipment to cooperate with their teammates or face off against enemies alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the standout features of this game is the rope action, which allows players to move quickly between buildings or strategically ambush enemies from high vantage points, providing a unique combat experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, with its long TTK, each battle is prolonged and more strategic, giving players more opportunities to turn the tide of combat.</p>",
    "short_description": "CIVITA is multiplayer FPS game Enjoy easy and fast movements using the rope action. Long TTK is a bonus! (Only supports Steam multiplayer)",
